  "title": "Sheboygan Grilled Brats",
  "description": "Finishing bratwurst in beer sauce just make them better. Serve them on hard rolls with mustard and the cooked onions. Hungry? Try the famous Sheboygan double-brat!",
  "authors": [
    "PBFITZ"
